------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 Conversation Start
Text=Salaam. We are relieved that you journeyed so far to fight the evil within the Alamut fortress. My sword is yours.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Where is the Old Man?
