------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=01 Conversation Start Knight Templar
Text=Salaam. It is an honor to stand with one of the Knights Templar - especially one who has journeyed so far to fight the evil within the Alamut fortress. Know that this Knight of Saladin stands with you, honoring the time when Richard and Saladin stood together at Acre.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Where is the Old Man?
Go to node ID=10 old man

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is inside Alamut?
Go to node ID=20 alamut

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Let's carry the battle to Alamut, then.
Go to node ID=30 go

Requirement=Templar IS
Reply Text=Our orders have been paying this man's order to leave us alone. Does that sit in you the way it sits in me?
Go to node ID=22 the tribute
