Node ID=22 the tribute
Text=It should sit badly in us both, brother of the Temple. Coin sent to a killer is a promise that he may go on killing, only somewhere else and to someone poorer. Today we send him something other than coin.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is inside Alamut?
Go to node ID=20 alamut

