------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=23 the tent
Text=Twice, and both times the guard woke before the blade came down. Saladin forgave a great many things in his life and he never forgave that. You carry his name into the one house he could not reach. Finish what his guards began.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is inside Alamut?
Go to node ID=20 alamut

