Go to node ID=30 go
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=24 the standing order
Text=Plainly, then. The order does not speak of Alamut in the chapter houses, so I will speak of it here, in the sand, where there is nobody to be shocked. Every Aswaran is told one thing on the day of the oath and never told it again: if the Old Man moves against the Sultan's house a third time, the highest of us who is nearest rides, and does not wait for permission, and does not come back with prisoners. In eighty years nobody has ever been nearest. You are nearest.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then the order has been waiting eighty years for today.
Go to node ID=30 go

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is inside Alamut?
Go to node ID=20 alamut
}
